    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1017">

                <pb facs="0918" n="910" sameAs="frus:frus1940v04/pg910"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1123/26: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-12-10T12:00:00-05:00">December 10,
                        1940—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>529. Peiping’s 502, December 4, 3 p.m.,<anchor n="54" xml:id="d1017-f1"/> Bard
                    incident.</p>
                <p>The Department assumes that you will in due course, in your discretion, take up
                    this matter with the Japanese Foreign Office in such manner as you may deem
                    appropriate, either as a separate matter or in conjunction with other
                        matters.<anchor n="55" xml:id="d1017-f2"/></p>
                <p>Sent to Tokyo via Peiping. Repeated to Chungking. Peiping mail to Tsinan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1017-f1" n="54" xml:id="d1017-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; see telegram of October 30, 10 p.m., from the Vice Consul at Tsinan,
                        <ref target="#pg906">p. 906</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1017-f2" n="55" xml:id="d1017-f2-content">
                <p>The Ambassador in Japan in his telegram No. 1328, December 17, 8 p.m., reported
                    he had made full oral representations to the Japanese Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs (393.1123/28).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
